<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 07-JUL.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 07-JUL.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storms Dolores is only a minor threat to shipping operation near Mexico as the storm is expected to increase in intensity over the next 36 hours.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.  </p>
